<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background: #F7F7F5; }
    .wrapper { padding: 32px 16px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #1B3A5C; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #C9A84C; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 14px; }
    .receipt-banner { background: #D1FAE5; padding: 16px 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; }
    .receipt-banner p { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #065F46; }
    .body { padding: 36px 40px; }
    .text { font-size: 14px; color: #64748B; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .card { background: #F7F7F5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .card h3 { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #64748B; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .label { font-size: 13px; color: #64748B; }
    .value { font-size: 13px; color: #0A0A0A; font-weight: 500; text-align: right; }
    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #E2E2D8; margin: 14px 0; }
    .amount-section { background: #1B3A5C; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 24px; }
    .amount-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .amount-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .amount-label { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
    .amount-value { font-size: 13px; color: #fff; font-weight: 500; }
    .amount-total-label { font-size: 14px; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
    .amount-total-value { font-size: 20px; color: #C9A84C; font-weight: 800; }
    .amount-remaining-label { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
    .amount-remaining-value { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
    .remaining-zero { color: #6EE7B7; }
    .remaining-nonzero { color: #FCD34D; }
    .method-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #F0F0EA; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #1B3A5C; }
    .status-paid { background: #D1FAE5; color: #065F46; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; }
    .status-partial { background: #FEF3C7; color: #B45309; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; }
    .gold { color: #C9A84C; font-weight: 600; }
    .footer { background: #F0F0EA; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #64748B; line-height: 1.7; }
    .receipt-note { font-size: 11px; color: #64748B; text-align: center; margin-top: 12px; padding: 12px; border: 1px dashed #E2E2D8; border-radius: 8px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🏨 {{hotelName}}</h1>
      <p>Biên lai thanh toán</p>
    </div>

    <div class="receipt-banner">
      <span>💳</span>
      <p>Xác nhận thanh toán thành công</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p class="text">Xin chào <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>, thanh toán của bạn đã được ghi nhận.</p>

      <!-- Payment Info -->
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Chi tiết thanh toán</h3>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Mã hóa đơn</span>
          <span class="value gold">#{{invoiceId}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Mã booking</span>
          <span class="value">#{{bookingId}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Thời gian</span>
          <span class="value">🕐 {{paidAt}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Phương thức</span>
          <div class="method-badge">
            {{#eq paymentMethod 'cash'}}💵 Tiền mặt{{/eq}}
            {{#eq paymentMethod 'bank_transfer'}}🏦 Chuyển khoản{{/eq}}
            {{#eq paymentMethod 'e_wallet'}}📱 Ví điện tử{{/eq}}
            {{#eq paymentMethod 'credit_card'}}💳 Thẻ tín dụng{{/eq}}
          </div>
        </div>
        {{#if referenceNumber}}
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Mã giao dịch</span>
          <span class="value">{{referenceNumber}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
        <hr class="divider">
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Trạng thái HĐ</span>
          {{#eq status 'paid'}}
          <span class="status-paid">✅ Đã thanh toán đủ</span>
          {{else}}
          <span class="status-partial">⏳ Thanh toán một phần</span>
          {{/eq}}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Amount Summary -->
      <div class="amount-section">
        <div class="amount-row">
          <span class="amount-label">Tổng hóa đơn</span>
          <span class="amount-value">{{totalAmount}} đ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amount-row">
          <span class="amount-label">Đã thanh toán (lần này)</span>
          <span class="amount-value">{{amount}} đ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amount-row">
          <span class="amount-label">Tổng đã thanh toán</span>
          <span class="amount-value">{{totalPaid}} đ</span>
        </div>
        <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);margin:12px 0">
        <div class="amount-row">
          <span class="amount-total-label">Còn lại</span>
          <span class="amount-total-value {{#eq remaining '0'}}remaining-zero{{else}}remaining-nonzero{{/eq}}">
            {{#eq remaining '0'}}✅ Đã thanh toán đủ{{else}}{{remaining}} đ{{/eq}}
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="receipt-note">
        🧾 Đây là biên lai điện tử chính thức. Vui lòng lưu lại để đối chiếu nếu cần.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p><strong>{{hotelName}}</strong></p>
      <p>{{hotelAddress}} | ☎ {{hotelPhone}}</p>
      <p>© {{currentYear}} {{hotelName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>